[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 5042.87, "timestamp": "01:24:02", "text": "我只是鼓起勇气而已。他现在少了100点生命值。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5046.83, "timestamp": "01:24:06", "text": "他的马力是600。该死。我勒个去？这"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5050.31, "timestamp": "01:24:10", "text": "他们把他的森林都毁了，兄弟。我勒个去？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5053.189, "timestamp": "01:24:13", "text": "是的，他的墙壁生命值更低。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5055.99, "timestamp": "01:24:15", "text": "现在。他的两面墙。甚至没有"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5058.39, "timestamp": "01:24:18", "text": "主要的那个。他的两面墙都比较薄弱。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5060.629, "timestamp": "01:24:20", "text": "现在就健康。人们可以把它撕碎，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5062.47, "timestamp": "01:24:22", "text": "但人们只是想禁播格鲁特，因为"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5063.51, "timestamp": "01:24:23", "text": "他们不想处理这件事"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5065.35, "timestamp": "01:24:25", "text": "绑架。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5067.59, "timestamp": "01:24:27", "text": "他们痛恨绑架。他们讨厌"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5070.229, "timestamp": "01:24:30", "text": "扎里·阿尔，兄弟。不。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5072.55, "timestamp": "01:24:32", "text": "哦，是查莉娅。哦。是的，那样更好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5074.229, "timestamp": "01:24:34", "text": "扎里等人好的。你无法逃脱"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5076.629, "timestamp": "01:24:36", "text": "那。你可以摆脱扎莉娅。真的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5078.39, "timestamp": "01:24:38", "text": "你可以净化自己，然后摆脱困境。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5081.149, "timestamp": "01:24:41", "text": "扎里奥，但这破事。绝对不行。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5083.75, "timestamp": "01:24:43", "text": "没错，兄弟。我当时在玩另一个游戏。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5086.31, "timestamp": "01:24:46", "text": "那天，我只是在用《守望先锋》的术语。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5088.07, "timestamp": "01:24:48", "text": "和"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5089.91, "timestamp": "01:24:49", "text": "这个家伙扮演的是星爵。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5091.51, "timestamp": "01:24:51", "text": "出色地。他扮演的是星爵。而他"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5094.31, "timestamp": "01:24:54", "text": "他因为我用了而对我大发雷霆"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5096.87, "timestamp": "01:24:56", "text": "这是守望先锋的术语，兄弟。他当时说：“如果"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 5098.79, "timestamp": "01:24:58", "text": "你想玩守望先锋，就去玩吧"}]